  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "HTTP DSL: Concurrently(n) and Concurrently(bodies) send a request several times at once, with AssertStatusCode over every response and AssertEach for any other assertion; HttpStepResult.Request is the request as it went out, cookies the client added included, with AssertRequestHeader, AssertSentCookie and AssertNoSentCookie; PostRaw, PutRaw and PatchRaw send a body exactly as written. Additive: no code changes needed from 6.5.0. Upgrade guide: https://github.com/andrewBezerra/xunit-assured-net/blob/main/UPGRADING.md",
